1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:04,335
Chats in one app. Files in another. Deadlines in your head.

2
00:00:04,585 --> 00:00:06,825
What if your whole project lived in one place?

3
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,178
Welcome to Collabify.

4
00:00:11,178 --> 00:00:15,255
One place where classes and teams plan, build, and finish together.

5
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:21,346
Make it yours. Pick every color, from your banners to your status highlights.

6
00:00:21,346 --> 00:00:22,212
Light, or dark.

7
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,868
Start with a work space.

8
00:00:27,868 --> 00:00:32,885
Every project your team runs lives here, with its own look, overview, and reports.

9
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:40,131
Give everyone a role: project manager, coordinator, member, QA, or stakeholder.

10
00:00:40,131 --> 00:00:45,097
Then build teams, with leads, positions, and the skills each person brings.

11
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:49,238
Turn a file or a meeting into work.

12
00:00:49,238 --> 00:00:54,182
Upload a plan, or pick a saved discussion, and Collabify drafts the tasks.

13
00:00:54,182 --> 00:00:56,052
You keep only what you want.

14
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,314
Too much for one person?

15
00:00:59,314 --> 00:01:06,092
Break down and balance splits a big task, and gives each piece to someone with the skills, and the hours, to do it.

16
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,576
Not sure how to pace it?

17
00:01:09,576 --> 00:01:13,875
Suggest sprints lays out the cycles for you, from your dates and your work.

18
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:18,469
Every project, your way.

19
00:01:18,469 --> 00:01:23,110
Set the stages, the task rules, priorities, subtasks, and dependencies.

20
00:01:23,110 --> 00:01:26,052
Then automate it: when this happens, do that.

21
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:33,435
And when it's time to talk, meet right inside Collabify. No links to another app.

22
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:40,240
In the classroom, teachers set up each class, its look, and its syllabus.

23
00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:44,533
Projects start from a brief.

24
00:01:44,533 --> 00:01:48,148
Tasks come from a file, and anything off the brief is flagged.

25
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:54,488
Groups plan and hand in. Teachers grade with a rubric, right on the work.

26
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,957
Students rate their team, too.

27
00:02:00,900 --> 00:02:04,484
And analytics show who needs help, with reports ready to export.

28
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:09,588
Collabify. Plan, build, and finish, together.
